-- RL2: move the issue #7 CAP far outside R512.
ALPHA LOG "D:/work/plant-code/old/gen-model/scripts/e3d/room_cap_out_apply.log" OVER
-- The CAP has no name of its own, so it is reached through its named BRAN:
-- refnos churn as elements come and go, the branch name does not. Note
-- $!CAPS[1] already expands to "=24383/66460" — do not prepend another "=".
/1WCC1135/B1
VAR !CAPS COLLECT ALL CAP FOR CE
$!CAPS[1]
Q CE
POS E -5001.4501953125 N 10705.8095703125 U 105821.669921875
Q POS
SAVEWORK 'CODEX room RL2: CAP outside R512'
ALPHA LOG END
